    Contains app.py (BankAccount, flatten, decorator) and test_app.py.
    Demonstrates multiple concepts in one file.
    Features:
        BankAccount (deposit, withdraw, balance).
        Flatten nested lists.
        Decorator to measure execution time.
    Requires pytest installed.
    Run tests with: pytest -v Assignment/.
    Run specific test: pytest -v Assignment/test_app.py::test_deposit.
    Example output shows PASSED tests.
    Self-contained mini-project for practicing pytest.